ent-NigWeaponBroadsword = NigWeapon Spatha Bellica
    .desc = A heavy double-edged broadsword. Delivers light slashes in one hand, devastating heavy strikes when wielded with two hands.

ent-NigWeaponBroadswordSheath = NigWeapon Theca Spathae
    .desc = A sturdy leather scabbard reinforced with metal bands to carry a broadsword on the belt or across the back.

ent-NigWeaponBigsword = NigWeapon Spatha Immensa
    .desc = A colossal two-handed greatsword of immense weight. Can only strike when wielded with two hands. Its sheer heft slows the bearer down, but cleaves foes in twain.

ent-NigWeaponSledgehammer = NigWeapon Malleus Bellicus
    .desc = A massive forged sledgehammer of immense crushing power. Must be swung with both hands. Shatters bone and demolishes structures with ease.

ent-NigWeaponClub = NigWeapon Clava Parva
    .desc = A short studded wooden club. A handy one-handed bludgeon for swift, bone-cracking strikes.

ent-NigWeaponSpear = NigWeapon Hasta Adamantina
    .desc = A formidable spear tipped with gleaming adamantine. Thrusts deep into armor and sinew alike.

ent-NigWeaponPaladinShield = NigWeapon Scutum Palatini
    .desc = A heavy kite shield of tempered steel emblazoned with a solemn cross. Absorbs devastating impacts and deflects fatal strikes.

ent-NigWeaponCrossbow = NigWeapon Arcuballista
    .desc = A heavy combat crossbow forged from tempered steel and dark ash. Cocked and loaded with a bolt to loose devastating armor-piercing shots.

ent-NigWeaponBolt = NigWeapon Bolus Arcuballistae
    .desc = A heavy forged iron bolt with a faceted point engineered to punch clean through heavy armor.

ent-NigWeaponQuiver = NigWeapon Pharetra Bolorum
    .desc = A sturdy leather bolt quiver designed to carry crossbow bolts on the belt or across the back.

ent-NigWeaponBardiche = NigWeapon Barducium
    .desc = A long-shafted heavy poleaxe with a broad crescent blade. Delivers devastating cleaving blows without impeding the bearer's movement.







ent-NigWeaponExecutionerAxe = NigWeapon Securis Carnificis
    .desc = An executioner's hand axe forged for decisive decapitations. Deals modest damage in open combat, but cleaves heads from shoulders in executions.

ent-NigWeaponKpfw = NigWeapon Kpfw-6 Ausf
    .desc = An experimental automatic rifle forged from darkened combat steel. Equipped with high-capacity box magazine feed and internal recoil dampers for devastating sustained fire.

ent-NigWeaponMagazineKpfw = NigWeapon Capsula Kpfw Ausf E
    .desc = A high-capacity steel box magazine containing 50 rounds of 5.56 ammunition for the Kpfw-6 automatic rifle.

ent-NigWeaponMagazineKpfwEmpty = NigWeapon Capsula Kpfw Ausf E
    .desc = A high-capacity steel box magazine for the Kpfw-6 automatic rifle.

ent-NigWeaponCartridgeKpfw = Cartuccia 5.56 Kpfw
    .desc = An experimental high-velocity 5.56 intermediate cartridge engineered for the Kpfw-6 combat rifle.

ent-NigWeaponGrenadeSmokebomb = NigWeapon Granata Bellica
    .desc = A heavy high-explosive fragmentation grenade. Detonates with devastating concussive force, shredding the terrain into high-velocity debris and fragments.


